"da": "Heldigvis blev jeg ikke skuffet!",
"en": "Luckily, I was not disappointed!",
"p": false,
"note": "He was happy. 'Blev skuffet' is a passive-like form with 'blive'. After 'Heldigvis' the verb comes first.",
